# Fix1 UI rules: delete + attachments

- Every destructive **Xoa** control must use `ConfirmDelete` with a **5 second** countdown; when time runs out, cancel automatically.
- Deleting an entire **article / case / software** entry: **admin only**.
- Article attachments: PDF, DOCX, JPEG, PNG; max **2MB** per file; max **5** files.
- Case attachments: same types; max **20MB** per file; max **10** files; editors may delete **one file at a time**.
- If a file exceeds the size limit, show a warning dialog and require **Da xem**. Do not upload the oversized file.
